=== zone z5q1
Cave
A large catacomb with several exits on the surface. Even the tough Orcs only managed to bring a small part of the cave under control, and they will not risk venturing into its depths where strange and unfamiliar creatures dwell.

=== zone z5q2
Cave
A large catacomb with several exits on the surface. Even the tough Orcs only managed to bring a small part of the cave under control, and they will not risk venturing into its depths where strange and unfamiliar creatures dwell.

=== zone z6q1
Middle Mountains
These mountains occupy the northern half of the area; the southern half is flatter and easier to traverse. The plains area is sparsely populated, so a cautious traveller could cross it without encountering a single enemy. The mountains are much more dangerous, so humans try to avoid them.

