=== zone z7q1
The river and the islands
The river which starts in the Remote Mountains flows into the Big Lake and forms a delta containing numerous islands. There are big Goblin and Orc settlements here, with houses and shrines. "Free hunters" also venture here, but they don't hang around too long.

=== zone z7q2
