=== zone z91q1
Tunnel
The tunnel is just another relic of ancient times, like other numerous Gipath ruins. Once upon a time it was the shortest and safest way through the mountains and into the ravine, but a lot has changed since then.

=== zone z92q1
Remote Mountains
This is the most remote area from the village. Humans are rare guests here, and occasions where they make it back alive are even rarer still. However, there is a rumor in the village that the Craftsman somehow found out how to reach the stone site located there.

